{
  "app_id": 3224540,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "In VOIDFACE , every enemy is a boss fight, bullet hell patterns litter the screen, and you only get one life. Think you have what it takes? Maybe, but be prepared to die. A LOT. Dodge and shoot your way through challenging encounters. Dismantle each boss piece-by-piece and get familiar with carefully handcrafted bullet patterns and attacks. Unlock all the hats and artworks! Because survival shouldn't come at the cost of style. Employ game-changing spells to give you an edge. Some are easier than others to master, but they can be key to survival. Good luck, have fun!"
  },
